---
import Base from '../../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Landlord Compliance Audit Ghana — Rent Act 220 Review | PRC" description="Full review of your property documentation, rent handling, and notice procedures against Act 220. Get a remediation checklist.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <a href="/services/" style="color:#516784; text-decoration:none; margin-bottom:1rem; display:inline-block;">← Back to Services</a>

      <h1>Landlord Compliance Audit</h1>
      <p class="muted" style="max-width:680px; margin-bottom:2rem;">A complete property-by-property review of your documentation, rent handling, tenant management, and notice practices — with a checklist of what to fix.</p>

      <div style="margin:2rem 0; padding:2rem; background:#f0f4f8; border-radius:8px;">
        <h2 style="margin-top:0;">Why You Need This Service</h2>
        <p style="line-height:1.8;">If a tenant lodges a complaint with the Rent Control Department, your documentation becomes evidence. Many landlords lose cases not because the law is against them, but because their records are weak, incomplete, or missing.</p>
        <p style="line-height:1.8; margin-top:1rem;">This audit checks:</p>
        <ul style="line-height:1.8; margin:1.5rem 0;">
          <li>Do you have signed leases for all tenants?</li>
          <li>Are rent receipts issued every payment?</li>
          <li>Is your rent advance handling compliant with Act 220?</li>
          <li>Are notices served correctly and documented?</li>
          <li>Is tenant information organized and traceable?</li>
          <li>Do you have evidence of maintenance and repair requests?</li>
          <li>Are your communication records organized chronologically?</li>
        </ul>
        <p style="line-height:1.8;"><strong>This is insurance.</strong> If you ever need to defend a position in Rent Court, a clean compliance record means you win.</p>
      </div>

      <div style="margin:2rem 0; padding:2rem; background:#f9f9f9; border-radius:8px;">
        <h2 style="margin-top:0;">What We Audit</h2>
        <ul style="line-height:1.8;">
          <li><strong>Lease Documentation:</strong> Are all leases signed, dated, and complete?</li>
          <li><strong>Rent Receipts:</strong> Do you issue receipts? Are they legible and traceable?</li>
          <li><strong>Rent Advance:</strong> Is advance rent handled and documented correctly?</li>
          <li><strong>Tenant Records:</strong> Can you quickly find info on any tenant?</li>
          <li><strong>Maintenance Handling:</strong> Are repair requests tracked and resolved?</li>
          <li><strong>Notice Procedures:</strong> Are notices served correctly with proof?</li>
          <li><strong>Communication Trail:</strong> Can you show chronology of interactions with tenants?</li>
          <li><strong>Payment Records:</strong> Are payments tracked and verifiable?</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div style="margin:2rem 0; padding:2rem; background:#f9f9f9; border-radius:8px;">
        <h2 style="margin-top:0;">What You Get</h2>
        <ul style="line-height:1.8;">
          <li><strong>Written Audit Report:</strong> Property-by-property review with findings</li>
          <li><strong>Compliance Checklist:</strong> What's good, what's missing, what needs fixing</li>
          <li><strong>Remediation Plan:</strong> Step-by-step guidance to get compliant</li>
          <li><strong>Documentation Templates:</strong> Forms and processes to use going forward</li>
          <li><strong>Risk Assessment:</strong> Which gaps pose the most legal risk</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div style="margin:2rem 0; padding:2rem; background:#fff3cd; border-radius:8px;">
        <h2 style="margin-top:0;">When You Need This Service</h2>
        <ul style="line-height:1.8;">
          <li>You manage multiple properties and want consistency</li>
          <li>You've had a rent complaint and want to check your records</li>
          <li>You're starting to take property management seriously</li>
          <li>You want to know if you could win a dispute if one arises</li>
          <li>You're about to apply for a business loan (banks like clean records)</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div style="margin:2rem 0; padding:2rem; background:#e8f4f8; border-radius:8px;">
        <h2 style="margin-top:0;">The Payoff</h2>
        <p style="line-height:1.8;">A good audit costs GHS 500–1,000. Losing a rent case because your records are weak costs thousands in lost rent, legal stress, and time. It's one of the best investments you can make.</p>
      </div>

      <div style="margin:2rem 0; padding:2rem; background:#f9f9f9; border-radius:8px;">
        <h2 style="margin-top:0;">Pricing & Turnaround</h2>
        <p style="font-size:1.2rem; font-weight:700; color:#516784; margin:0;">GHS 500 – 1,000</p>
        <p style="color:#666; margin:0.5rem 0;">Depends on number of properties and tenant records</p>
        <p style="font-weight:600; margin-top:1rem;">Turnaround: 3–5 working days</p>
      </div>

      <div style="margin:3rem 0; text-align:center;">
        <a href="/services/" style="display:inline-block; padding:1rem 2rem; background:#516784; color:white; text-decoration:none; border-radius:4px; font-weight:600; margin-right:1rem;">Request a Quote</a>
        <a href="https://wa.me/233208071633" style="display:inline-block; padding:1rem 2rem; background:#f0f4f8; color:#516784; text-decoration:none; border-radius:4px; font-weight:600; border:1px solid #516784;">Chat on WhatsApp</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
